							WHY WE NEED THIS:
							Keycloak bundles many libraries internally (Jackson, Netty, Guava, SLF4J,
							Apache Commons, etc.) and different Keycloak versions use different library
							versions. Without shading, we get runtime conflicts:

							  WITHOUT SHADING → NoSuchMethodError, ClassNotFoundException, version conflicts
							  WITH SHADING    → Extension works across Keycloak 25.x, 26.x+ without recompilation

